{"term": {"label": "德", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "4A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/li-lou-i", "title": "離婁上", "description": "孟子曰：「離婁之明，公輸子之巧，不以規矩，不能成方員：師曠之聰，不以六律，不能正五音；堯舜之道，不以仁政，不能平治天下。今有仁心仁聞而民不被其澤，不可法於後世者，不行先王之道也。\n「故曰，徒善不足以為政，徒法不能以自行。《詩》云：『不愆不忘，率由舊章。』遵先王之法而過者，未之有也。聖人既竭目力焉，繼之以規矩準繩，以為方", "occurrences": 4, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "受", "id": "受"}, {"form": "君子", "id": "君子"}, {"form": "命", "id": "命"}, {"form": "國", "id": "國"}, {"form": "大", "id": "大"}, {"form": "夫子", "id": "夫子"}, {"form": "子", "id": "子"}, {"form": "守", "id": "守"}, {"form": "小", "id": "小"}, {"form": "師", "id": "師"}, {"form": "年", "id": "年"}, {"form": "役", "id": "役"}, {"form": "後", "id": "後"}, {"form": "德", "variants": [], "id": "德"}, {"form": "恥", "id": "恥"}, {"form": "教", "id": "敎"}, {"form": "易", "id": "易"}, {"form": "正", "id": "正"}, {"form": "老", "id": "老"}, {"form": "身", "id": "身"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.241676339907053, "source": "守", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 2.1546649629174235, "source": "守", "target": "身"}, {"weight": 1.8362112317988888, "source": "老", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 2.624668592163159, "source": "夫子", "target": "敎"}, {"weight": 2.7300291078209855, "source": "夫子", "target": "正"}, {"weight": 3.0301337002713233, "source": "德", "target": "敎"}, {"weight": 2.241676339907053, "source": "德", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 3.0301337002713233, "source": "德", "target": "小"}, {"weight": 3.5409593240373143, "source": "德", "target": "役"}, {"weight": 1.749199854809259, "source": "易", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 3.5409593240373143, "source": "易", "target": "子"}, {"weight": 2.624668592163159, "source": "易", "target": "敎"}, {"weight": 1.325385608032898, "source": "後", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 2.9348235204669986, "source": "役", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 3.7232808808312687, "source": "役", "target": "小"}, {"weight": 3.3178157727231046, "source": "恥", "target": "受"}, {"weight": 3.5409593240